==============================================================================
PART 0: integer-part decomposition of the partial-sum walk (the 7-band split)
==============================================================================
S_e = floor(e*theta) mod 7 with theta=j+a  ==>  S_e = (e*j + floor(e*a)) mod 7.
AP part (step j mod 7) twisted by Sturmian defect floor(e*a). Cover is 7-periodic in j.
  a=1/3: cover by j=0..6 [0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0]  7-periodic in j? True
  a=1/5: cover by j=0..6 [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1]  7-periodic in j? True
  a=2/5: cover by j=0..6 [0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0]  7-periodic in j? True
  a=3/7: cover by j=0..6 [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]  7-periodic in j? True
  a=2/9: cover by j=0..6 [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1]  7-periodic in j? True
  ==> cover EXACTLY 7-periodic in integer part j? True  (each band = Z/7 twist, HYP-2703)

